# Canonical author identities.
#
# Contributors here have committed under several names and addresses over the
# years -- personal vs work email, GitLab web-UI merge commits, machine
# hostnames. This file collapses them so `git shortlog`, `git blame` and the
# release-contributor detection in .gitlab-ci.yml each attribute work to one
# identity per person.
#
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email>  <other@email>
#     or: Canonical Name <canonical@email>  Other Name <other@email>
#
# Prefer the address the person uses on GitHub as the canonical one: published
# release commits carry Co-authored-by trailers built from these values, and
# GitHub only links the credit to a profile when it recognises the address.
#
# When a new contributor commits under more than one identity, add them here.

